import{_ as i,o,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 286 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Law-First Axiom Comparison: How Heng Yuan Zhou Avoids Tang-Luo-Style Limitations","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 286 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Law-First Axiom Comparison: How Heng Yuan Zhou Avoids Tang-Luo-Style Limitations","no":286,"module":2,"tags":["Tang-Luo","Law-First Axiom","Heng Yuan Zhou","Avoiding Limitations","Myriad-Realms Benchmark"],"related":["40-Symbiotic Constitution Outline","97-Setting Contradiction Self-Check Table","99-Document Version and Maintenance Notes"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0286_模块2-唐罗-法则优先公理对照.md","filePath":"en/0286_模块2-唐罗-法则优先公理对照.md"}'),a={name:"en/0286_模块2-唐罗-法则优先公理对照.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,d,c){return o(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-286-tang-luo-decomposition-law-first-axiom-comparison-how-heng-yuan-zhou-avoids-tang-luo-style-limitations" tabindex="-1">Entry 286 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Law-First Axiom Comparison: How Heng Yuan Zhou Avoids Tang-Luo-Style Limitations <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-286-tang-luo-decomposition-law-first-axiom-comparison-how-heng-yuan-zhou-avoids-tang-luo-style-limitations" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 286 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Law-First Axiom Comparison: How Heng Yuan Zhou Avoids Tang-Luo-Style Limitations&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Tang-Luo System (Entry 36, the entry before the finale)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-why-heng-yuan-zhou-does-not-repeat-tang-luo-s-mistakes" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Why Heng Yuan Zhou does not repeat Tang Luo&#39;s mistakes <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-why-heng-yuan-zhou-does-not-repeat-tang-luo-s-mistakes" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Why Heng Yuan Zhou does not repeat Tang Luo&#39;s mistakes&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the law-first axiom is the last, also the highest-execution one: laws first, never retcon, never end badly; setting self-consistency over plot convenience, plot must not kidnap setting. This entry as the second-to-last in the series systematically compares: how Heng Yuan Zhou structurally avoids all Tang-Luo system limitations through the law-first axiom. Protagonist uniqueness dependency judgment: <strong>Tang Luo = high dependency / bestowal-style civilization</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-heng-yuan-zhou-comparison" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Heng-Yuan-Zhou Comparison) <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-heng-yuan-zhou-comparison" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Heng-Yuan-Zhou Comparison)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How Heng Yuan Zhou avoids Tang-Luo&#39;s energy waste:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Tang-Luo Waste</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou Avoidance Mechanism</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Racial exclusivity</td><td>Myriad Races republican axiom constitutionalized, exclusivity is unconstitutional</td></tr><tr><td>Tier cap</td><td>Nine realms + Multiverse + Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse, infinite expansion</td></tr><tr><td>Bestowal attachment</td><td>Myriad Races republican co-construction, evolution qualification naturalized</td></tr><tr><td>Single-point distribution</td><td>Alaya distributed network</td></tr><tr><td>Time decay</td><td>Good policies constitutionalized, legacy-favor no decay</td></tr><tr><td>Knowledge private hoarding</td><td>300 systems fully public</td></tr><tr><td>Supervision blanks</td><td>Alaya whole-network coverage</td></tr><tr><td>Karma unreported</td><td>Observe-first-then-limited-interfere + only-return-knowledge</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Each avoidance mechanism is a law, not one person&#39;s good will.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-heng-yuan-zhou-comparison" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Heng-Yuan-Zhou Comparison) <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-heng-yuan-zhou-comparison" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Heng-Yuan-Zhou Comparison)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How Heng Yuan Zhou avoids historical regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Single-point dependency eliminated</strong>: SPDCI drops from 0.82 to 0.05, any individual exits, civilization runs as usual</li><li><strong>Good policies constitutionalized</strong>: legacy-favor decay rule legislatively blocked</li><li><strong>Anti-monopoly constitutionalized</strong>: old-force restoration is unconstitutional</li><li><strong>Law-anchored</strong>: strong ones also judged, no arbitrary discretion</li><li><strong>Alaya supervision</strong>: grassroots distortion real-time alerts</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-heng-yuan-zhou-comparison" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Heng-Yuan-Zhou Comparison) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-heng-yuan-zhou-comparison" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Heng-Yuan-Zhou Comparison)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How Heng Yuan Zhou roots out predatory thinking:</p><ul><li>Not relying on personal morality, but on institutional structure</li><li>Not relying on &quot;a better Tang Luo,&quot; but on &quot;a network that does not need Tang Luo&quot;</li><li>Not relying on good-will radius, but on law coverage</li><li>Not relying on a benefactor&#39;s mood, but on law anchoring</li></ul><p>Heng Yuan Zhou does not deny Tang Luo&#39;s goodness, but Heng Yuan Zhou knows: once goodness is written into law, it no longer depends on the good person being in office.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s complete alternative system:</p><ol><li><strong>Legislative layer</strong>: Myriad Races Republican Civilization Charter + Anti-Monopoly Law + Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee Law</li><li><strong>Executive layer</strong>: Anchor Council + Symbiotic Executive Committee</li><li><strong>Judicial layer</strong>: Symbiotic Court</li><li><strong>Supervisory layer</strong>: Anchor Supervision Committee</li><li><strong>Network layer</strong>: Alaya whole-network sharing + multi-layer supervision</li><li><strong>Law layer</strong>: Law-anchored authority benefits all beings</li><li><strong>Time layer</strong>: good policies constitutionalized, legacy-favor no decay</li><li><strong>Cross-plane layer</strong>: observe-first-then-limited-interfere + only-return-knowledge</li></ol><p>Eight-layer structure, every link connected. Any layer damaged, other layers auto-backfill.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: Heng Yuan Zhou complete institutional model</li><li><strong>Stress tests</strong>: simulate various extreme scenarios (single-point exit, external shock, cross-plane disturbance)</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: SPDCI, energy utilization, Myriad-Races coverage</li><li><strong>Review conclusion</strong>: under all extreme scenarios, Heng Yuan Zhou civilization does not collapse — proving the law-first axiom&#39;s structural effectiveness</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Heng Yuan Zhou setting self-consistency: high</strong> (far above Tang-Luo&#39;s medium-high)</li><li><strong>Heng Yuan Zhou retcon-ending risk: extremely low</strong> (far below Tang-Luo&#39;s medium)</li><li><strong>Reason</strong>: laws first, all settings legislate before expansion; new dimensions (Multiverse, Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse) incrementally interface with appendix standard, never overturn old settings</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: Heng Yuan Zhou = extremely low (network style)</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: eight-layer structure raises utilization from 20% to 90%+</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: laws first, predation nowhere to hide</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Heng Yuan Zhou does not pursue &quot;a better Tang Luo,&quot; but &quot;a civilization that does not need Tang Luo&quot;</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: eight-layer structure covers 99%</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: can expand infinitely without collapse</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-discussion-comparative-verification-of-law-first" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Discussion: Comparative Verification of Law-First <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-discussion-comparative-verification-of-law-first" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Discussion: Comparative Verification of Law-First&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How does Heng Yuan Zhou avoid Tang-Luo-style limitations? The core answer is the law-first axiom. In the Tang-Luo system personal will stands above law; in Heng Yuan Zhou law is the meta-rule, however strong an individual is, still within the law framework. The Alaya Network embeds the law-first axiom into all systems&#39; underlying code; the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s Myriad Races Council can only decide within the law framework, cannot modify underlying laws. The universal equal infinite law as one of the six axioms is law-first&#39;s concrete embodiment — laws are equally effective for Myriad Races, do not bend with plot.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Why does Heng Yuan Zhou not repeat Tang Luo&#39;s mistakes? Not because it is &quot;better,&quot; but because &quot;laws first.&quot; Tang Luo&#39;s goodness is real, but goodness cannot be transmitted; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s law is hard, law can be transmitted. From goodness to law is civilization&#39;s coming-of-age ceremony.</p><p>In the final analysis, Tang-Luo · law-first axiom comparison described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./40-共生宪法总纲.html">40-Symbiotic Constitution Outline</a> · <a href="./97-设定矛盾自查表.html">97-Setting Contradiction Self-Check Table</a> · <a href="./99-文档版本与维护说明.html">99-Document Version and Maintenance Notes</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const m=i(a,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
